fix(admin-blocklist): apply rate-limit to DELETE handler too

Found in cycle 5 audit-window read: the previous commit added a
rate-limit `request` arg to deleteEntry's call sites but forgot
to declare it on the function itself, so DELETE bypassed the
60/min cap that POST honored.

Signature alignment only; no behavior change for the happy path.
DELETE now joins POST under the same `admin-blocklist-write` bucket.

